# Schnorr Knowledge — "I know the discrete log of a public key"
#
# Proves knowledge of secret key sk such that pk == [sk]g,
# where g is the BLS12-381 G1 generator.
#
# This demonstrates: secret scalars, public G1 points, scalar multiplication.

Secret Int Inputs: (sk)
Public G1 Inputs: (pk)
Constants:
    g  # G1 generator

compute: p = [sk]g
check: pk == p
